WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.380
Okay, so technically, this never happened to me,

2
00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:06.160
because generally, when you’re having an interview,

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.980
the recruiter is trying to get the best out of you,

4
00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.500
so they give you this space

5
00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:15.240
so you can express yourself and explain your ideas.

6
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.860
However, if this happens to you, what I recommend

7
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.940
is to first let them finish their sentence,

8
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.520
and then you can say something like:

9
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.400
“Yes, I understand. Just to finish my point…”

10
00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:32.150
And then you can finish explaining your points. That’s it.
